# awkward-cuda-compute talk: generated build artifacts
# (deck is rebuilt from scripts/*.py -> slides.md -> slides.pdf; figs/*.png and
#  slides.md are kept as tracked deck content, since some figures need a GPU to regenerate)
presentations/slides/awkward-cuda-compute/marp/slides.pdf
# transient benchmark json in scripts/ is regenerable; the curated per-machine
# results (results/<MACHINE>/*.json) ARE tracked (the paper's data).
presentations/slides/awkward-cuda-compute/marp/scripts/**/*.json

# awkward-cuda-compute talk: previous / reference presentations (not part of the build)
